# Frontend (Vite)

- Entrypoints live in `frontend/entrypoints/` (`theme.js`, `theme.scss`).
- New components go in `frontend/components/` and are imported from the entrypoints.
- Prefer custom elements / small modules (see `Slider.js`) over global scripts.
- Style with Tailwind v4 (`@use "tailwindcss"`) and component SCSS as needed.
- Keep `vite.config.js` output names as `*.min.js` / `*.min[extname]` so `.gitignore` patterns stay valid.
- After substantive frontend edits, verify with `pnpm vite:build`.
- Do not hand-edit generated `assets/theme.*.min.*` or `assets/manifest.json`.
